# The repository root ignores `**/charts/` — there it means Helm output that
# kustomize generates and nobody should commit. In THIS tree `charts/` holds
# real, hand-maintained content: the pulled OCI charts and, under
# chart/charts/, the two subcharts of the umbrella (one of which is a vendored,
# patched tgz that the chart cannot render without).
#
# Re-include them. Without this the umbrella pushes as 20 files with no
# subcharts and does not render for anyone who clones it.
!charts/
!chart/charts/
!chart/charts/**

# The root also ignores CLAUDE.md. This tree's notes are deliberate content.
!CLAUDE.md
